Subject: price list stand-ins have a price; combo deck counts are EDHREC-wide

Found on the live 0.7.46 gateway, 2026-11-10 (connector ledger).

scryfall_price_list priced "2 Island" (no set named) at SLD #2755, a Secret
Lair printing released the day before with no price yet, so the line was
left out of the total. A line that names no set is now priced at the newest
released paper printing that HAS a price in the finish asked for; with no
priced printing at all it is as before. Only the price list asks for this
(_default_printing(priced=True)); format_archidekt and scryfall_named keep the
newest printing out on paper.

edhrec_combos printed EDHREC's per-combo deck counts (Hullbreaker Horror +
Sol Ring: 367,460 decks) under a commander with 17,420 decks, with nothing
saying the count is site-wide. A line under the header now says so.

